                                    "speaker": "Kaeya",
                                    "text": "Pictures? That's a vacation staple for sure."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "700600105",
                                    "speaker": "Kaeya",
                                    "text": "It took me ages to get to Natlan... and I still haven't had the chance to take a good look around. Once I finish my drink, I'll look for some picture-worthy spots."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "700600106",
                                    "speaker": "Player",
                                    "text": "We can go together."
                                },
